utton label to navigate to the Stock Transfer transaction page\nstock_transfer=Пренос на запас\n# XMIT: Popover menu button label to navigate to the Recent Transfers page\nrecent_transfers=Скорошни преноси\n# XMIT: Popover menu button label to navigate to the Add To Order transaction page\nadd_to_order=Добавяне към поръчка\n# XMIT: Popover menu button label to navigate to the Issue To transaction page\nissue_to=Издаване за\n# XMIT: Popover menu button label to navigate to the Receive From transaction page\nreceive_from=Получаване от\n# XMIT: Popover menu button label to Adhoc Issue Stock\nadhoc_issue=Ад хок отпускане\n# XMIT: Popover menu button label to Adhoc Receipt Stock\nadhoc_receipt=ад хок постъпване\n# XMIT: Popover menu button label to Issue Stock\nissue=Отпускане\n# XMIT: Popover menu button label to Receipt Stock\nreceipt=Постъпване\n# XMIT: Popover menu button label to navigate to the Stock Lookup page\nstock_lookup=Търсене на запас\n# XMIT: Popover menu button label to navigate to the Vehicle Stock Lookup page\nvehicle_stock_lookup=Търсене на запас от превозно средство\n# XTIT: Heading for the Material Details section on the Stock Transfer Details page\nmaterial_details=Подробни данни за материал\n# XFLD: Label on the Issue or Receipt transaction page\ngl_account=Сметка от Главна книга\n# XFLD: Label on the Issue or Receipt transaction page for sales order\nsales_order=Клиентска поръчка\n# XFLD: Label on the Issue or Receipt transaction page for sales order item\nsales_order_item=Позиция на клиентска поръчка\n# XFLD: Label on the Material Document details page\ngm_code_01=Стоки, постъпили за поръчка за доставка\n# XFLD: Label on the Material Document details page\ngm_code_02=Стоки, постъпили за производствена поръчка\n# XFLD: Label on the Material Document details page\ngm_code_03=Отпускане на стоки\n# XFLD: Label on the Material Document details page\ngm_code_04=Осчетоводяване на пренос\n# XFLD: Label on the Material Document details page\ngm_code_05=Др